\beta {c}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }((\\alpha {a}_{n}+\\beta {c}_{n})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+(\\alpha {b}_{n}+\\beta {d}_{n})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)).\n$$\n\nUsing the linearity property of Fourier series, the corresponding Fourier coefficients of $4f(x)-g(x)$ are\n\n- $4{a}_{0}-{c}_{0}$ for the constant coefficient,\n\n- $4{a}_{n}-{c}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1$ for the cosine coefficients, and\n\n- $4{b}_{n}-{d}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1$ for the sine coefficients.\n\nTherefore, the $4$th cosine coefficient of $4f(x)-g(x)$ is\n\n$$\n4{a}_{4}-{c}_{4}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315013 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229173 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eb295d6c-62fe-59bc-a139-49785ac98f1f" :knowledge-point/title "Using Linearity of Fourier Series"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "260ad622-0789-5dd2-9798-9f4cd72091b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3{b}_{5}-2{d}_{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312263} {:answer/id #uuid "438d1124-553a-54e7-98d1-7380e4a7a894" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3{a}_{5}-2{c}_{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312516} {:answer/id #uuid "498f2343-ad1b-5305-bb4e-b84a56b7e8bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3{a}_{0}-2{d}_{0}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312566} {:answer/id #uuid "5a0a0508-d77a-50fe-9d06-dcf3ea5090bf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3{c}_{0}-2{d}_{0}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312694} {:answer/id #uuid "e54beaec-a00f-5125-b2b1-c767154adc8c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3{a}_{5}-2{b}_{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313786}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "438d1124-553a-54e7-98d1-7380e4a7a894" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3{a}_{5}-2{c}_{5}" 